{{set "inventory" (array)}}
You're standing in a long corridor, with a [[storeroom]] at one end and a door at the other.

[[storeroom]]:
On the shelves there's a [lamp], a [rope] and a [key]. When you're done, go back to the [[corridor]].

[lamp]:
{{#if (contains "inventory" "lamp")}}You already have the lamp.{{else}}{{append "inventory" "lamp"}}You take the lamp.{{/if}}

[rope]:
{{#if (contains "inventory" "rope")}}You already have the rope.{{else}}{{append "inventory" "rope"}}You take the rope.{{/if}}

[key]:
{{#if (contains "inventory" "key")}}You already have the key.{{else}}{{append "inventory" "key"}}You take the key.{{/if}}

[[corridor]]:
In your bag: {{#each inventory}}{{#unless @first}}, {{/unless}}{{this}}{{else}}nothing{{/each}}.

{{#if (contains "inventory" "key")}}
You unlock the door. [[Go through it]](outside)
{{else}}
The door is locked. Perhaps there's a key in the [[storeroom]].
{{/if}}

[[outside]]:
@end
You step out into the sunshine.
